  "description": "Framework-agnostic core for text-snapshot assertions. Provides string-against-file comparison with line-ending / BOM / whitespace options, TestContext-aware default file naming, environment-variable-driven accept-mode workflow with CI guard, and line-based diff rendering. Test-framework-specific entry points live in adapter packages (SnapshotAssertions.TUnit ships today; xUnit, NUnit, MSTest adapters are possible if there is demand).",
